discogs-effnet.onnx

Discogs-EffNet (discogs-effnet-bs64-1), an EfficientNet trained on 400 Discogs
styles, converted from Essentia's TensorFlow graph by convert-effnet.sh:
tf2onnx 1.17.0 (opset 17), then the graph's fixed batch of 64 replaced by a
variable one in its Reshape targets. The script checks the result against
TensorFlow before writing it.

